{"inkVersion":21,"root":[[{"->":"Begining"},"#","^speaker: Marcus ","/#","#","^portrait:marcus ","/#","#","^layout:left","/#","#","^speaker: Sennah ","/#","#","^portrait:sennah ","/#","#","^layout:right","/#",["done",{"#f":5,"#n":"g-0"}],null],"done",{"Begining":[["^Thank you for coming Sennah, im glad to see you here. ","#","^speaker: Marcus ","/#","#","^portrait:marcus ","/#","#","^layout:left","/#","\n","^Emma was my friend, a kindred spirit of sorts. How are you processing everything Marcus? ","#","^speaker: Sennah ","/#","#","^portrait:sennah ","/#","#","^layout:right","/#","\n","ev","str","^I'm okay","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^I'm fine","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},"ev","str","^Same as Nick","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-2","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ Im okay. Maybe it just hasnt hit me yet, that I will never see her again. ","#","^speaker: Marcus ","/#","#","^portrait:marcus ","/#","#","^layout:left","/#","\n",{"->":"ImOkay"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["^ I am fine. We knew she was ill. it still hurts though ","#","^speaker: Marcus ","/#","#","^portrait:marcus ","/#","#","^layout:left","/#","\n",{"->":"ImFine"},{"#f":5}],"c-2":["^ About the same as nick id say, still processing. ","#","^speaker: Marcus ","/#","#","^portrait:marcus ","/#","#","^layout:left","/#","\n",{"->":"Nick"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"ImOkay":[["^Dont think about it like that. ","#","^speaker: Sennah ","/#","#","^portrait:sennah ","/#","#","^layout:right","/#","\n","^You and I understand better than anyone that because she is still with us in our souls we have not yet lost her ","#","^speaker: Sennah ","/#","#","^portrait:sennah ","/#","#","^layout:right","/#","\n","ev","str","^How do you know","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^Thank you","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ How do you know this stuff? ","#","^speaker: Marcus ","/#","#","^portrait:marcus ","/#","#","^layout:left","/#","\n",{"->":"HowDoYouKnow"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["^ Thank you Sennah. That does make me feel better ","#","^speaker: Marcus ","/#","#","^portrait:marcus ","/#","#","^layout:left","/#","\n",{"->":"Thankyou"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"ImFine":[["^She is in a better place now. ","#","^speaker: Sennah ","/#","#","^portrait:sennah ","/#","#","^layout:right","/#","\n","^You and I understand better than anyone that because she is still with us in our souls we have not yet lost her ","#","^speaker: Sennah ","/#","#","^portrait:sennah ","/#","#","^layout:right","/#","\n","ev","str","^How do you know","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^Thank you","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ How do you know this stuff? ","#","^speaker: Marcus ","/#","#","^portrait:marcus ","/#","#","^layout:left","/#","\n",{"->":"HowDoYouKnow"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["^ Thank you Sennah. That does make me feel better ","#","^speaker: Marcus ","/#","#","^portrait:marcus ","/#","#","^layout:left","/#","\n",{"->":"Thankyou"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"HowDoYouKnow":[["^Because the spirits have told me. They were fond of your sister just as the people were ","#","^speaker: Sennah ","/#","#","^portrait:sennah ","/#","#","^layout:right","/#","\n","^You mean those floating jellyfish? they dont even have mouths  ","#","^speaker: Marcus ","/#","#","^portrait:marcus ","/#","#","^layout:left","/#","\n","^Oh Nick. you dont need a mouth to communicate. ","#","^speaker: Sennah ","/#","#","^portrait:sennah ","/#","#","^layout:right","/#","\n","^Sennah looks off in a direction and giggles, seemingly at nothing. ","#","^speaker:Narrorator ","/#","#","^portrait:Narrorator ","/#","#","^layout:right","/#","\n","ev","str","^laughing at me?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^Whats over there?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ Are you laughing at me? ","#","^speaker: Marcus ","/#","#","^portrait:marcus ","/#","#","^layout:left","/#","\n",{"->":"TakeCareOfYourself"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["^ Whats over there? ","#","^speaker: Marcus ","/#","#","^portrait:marcus ","/#","#","^layout:left","/#","\n",{"->":"TakeCareOfYourself"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"TakeCareOfYourself":["^Take care of yourself Marcus ","#","^speaker: Sennah ","/#","#","^portrait:sennah ","/#","#","^layout:right ","/#","#","^hide:toMarcusRoomNight","/#","\n","end",{"#f":1}],"Thankyou":[["^Your sister cares for you deeply nick, even if she cant tell you.","#","^speaker: Sennah ","/#","#","^portrait:sennah ","/#","#","^layout:right","/#","\n","^You can feel the aura of her that lingers, focus on it ","#","^speaker: Sennah ","/#","#","^portrait:sennah ","/#","#","^layout:right","/#","\n","^you close your eyes and focus deeply. You feel nothing but the stale air of a funeral. ","#","^speaker:Narrorator ","/#","#","^portrait:Narrorator ","/#","#","^layout:right","/#","\n","ev","str","^Lie","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^Truth","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ I can feel her warmth. But it makes me sad, ","#","^speaker: Marcus ","/#","#","^portrait:marcus ","/#","#","^layout:left","/#","\n","^it doesnt feel the same as when she was with us physically. In my head it is just the memory of what it was like ","#","^speaker: Marcus ","/#","#","^portrait:marcus ","/#","#","^layout:left","/#","\n",{"->":"Lie"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["^ I cant feel anything. Shes moved on, its best for everyone if we both accept that ","#","^speaker: Marcus ","/#","#","^portrait:marcus ","/#","#","^layout:left","/#","\n",{"->":"Lie"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"Lie":[["^Do what helps you move on, everyone grieves the dead differently. One of the many odd quirks about humans. ","#","^speaker: Sennah ","/#","#","^portrait:sennah ","/#","#","^layout:right","/#","\n","^You say that as if you're not ","#","^speaker: Marcus ","/#","#","^portrait:marcus ","/#","#","^layout:left","/#","\n","^Sometimes, that is how i feel. More in common with the spirits than man. ","#","^speaker: Sennah ","/#","#","^portrait:sennah ","/#","#","^layout:right","/#","\n","^Its no different than aligning yourself with one of those videogame characters ","#","^speaker: Sennah ","/#","#","^portrait:sennah ","/#","#","^layout:right","/#","\n","ev","str","^I dont know...","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^we still need you here","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ I dont know that its the same... ","#","^speaker: Marcus ","/#","#","^portrait:marcus ","/#","#","^layout:left","/#","\n",{"->":"IDontKnow"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["^ Dont go flying away with them yet, we still need you down here ","#","^speaker: Marcus ","/#","#","^portrait:marcus ","/#","#","^layout:left","/#","\n",{"->":"WeStillNeedYouHere"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"WeStillNeedYouHere":[["^oh if i could fly away with them we probably would have never met to have this conversation ","#","^speaker: Sennah ","/#","#","^portrait:sennah ","/#","#","^layout:right","/#","\n","ev","str","^That hurts","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^Dont be so sure","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ That hurts my feelings ","#","^speaker: Marcus ","/#","#","^portrait:marcus ","/#","#","^layout:left","/#","\n",{"->":"TakeCareOfYourself"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["^ I think we still would meet one way or another ","#","^speaker: Marcus ","/#","#","^portrait:marcus ","/#","#","^layout:left","/#","\n",{"->":"TakeCareOfYourself"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"IDontKnow":[["^You and Emma of all people should understand its more similar than one might think ","#","^speaker: Sennah ","/#","#","^portrait:sennah ","/#","#","^layout:right","/#","\n","ev","str","^What do you mean?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ ","#","^speaker: Marcus ","/#","#","^portrait:marcus ","/#","#","^layout:left","/#","\n",{"->":"TakeCareOfYourself"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"Nick":[["^I can sense there is more to his grief than meets the eye. Keep an eye on him as a friend will you? ","#","^speaker: Sennah ","/#","#","^portrait:sennah ","/#","#","^layout:right","/#","\n","ev","str","^Like what?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^Obviously","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ Like what exactly? ","#","^speaker: Marcus ","/#","#","^portrait:marcus ","/#","#","^layout:left","/#","\n",{"->":"LikeWhat"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["^ Obviously, his fiance just died ","#","^speaker: Marcus ","/#","#","^portrait:marcus ","/#","#","^layout:left","/#","\n",{"->":"Obviously"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"LikeWhat":[["^Hes your friend not mine marcus, if he wants you to know he will tell you. Im just saying be there for him too. ","#","^speaker: Sennah ","/#","#","^portrait:sennah ","/#","#","^layout:right","/#","\n","ev","str","^Thats vague","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^Youre weird","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ Are you being purposely vague? ","#","^speaker: Marcus ","/#","#","^portrait:marcus ","/#","#","^layout:left","/#","\n",{"->":"YoureWeird"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["^ You are just as weird as he says you are ","#","^speaker: Marcus ","/#","#","^portrait:marcus ","/#","#","^layout:left","/#","\n",{"->":"YoureWeird"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"Obviously":[["ev","str","^\"us humans\"","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^Youre weird","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ Well \"us humans\" dont like being overanalyzed. Be carful how much of your spiritness you talk about ","#","^speaker: Marcus ","/#","#","^portrait:marcus ","/#","#","^layout:left","/#","\n",{"->":"YoureWeird"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["^ You are just as weird as he says you are ","#","^speaker: Marcus ","/#","#","^portrait:marcus ","/#","#","^layout:left","/#","\n",{"->":"YoureWeird"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"YoureWeird":["^I cant help it. Emma really liked talking about it with me. ","#","^speaker: Sennah ","/#","#","^portrait:sennah ","/#","#","^layout:right ","/#","#","^hide:toMarcusRoomNight","/#","\n","^I know i said shes with us in spirit, but I will miss our talks ","#","^speaker: Sennah ","/#","#","^portrait:sennah ","/#","#","^layout:right ","/#","#","^hide:toMarcusRoomNight","/#","\n","end",{"#f":1}],"#f":1}],"listDefs":{}}